{"articleNo":"128584","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=128584&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"김용택 시인 초청 북콘서트","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2015.05.11","hit":"2785","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2015 학부교육 선도대학 육성사업의 일환으로 독서를 통하여 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">전인적인 인성함양과&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">감성역량을 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">강화하고, 책 읽는 캠퍼스 문화를 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">활성화 하기 위하여 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><font color=\"#0055ff\"><u>\"김용택 시인 초청 북콘서트</u>\"</font></strong>를</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">개최하오니 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">많이 참석하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><strong><font color=\"#0900ff\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"http://library.kumoh.ac.kr/education/Edu.Main.ax\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><font color=\"#0900ff\">참가신청 바로가기</font></span></a></font></strong></p><p><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p><p><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;온라인 신청기간은 2015.5.18.(월)까지 입니다.</span></p><img style=\"WIDTH: 690px; HEIGHT: 879px\" alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/upload/69d05759-753c-429b-8e43-8213e427b729.jpg